3. Optimization Techniques Applied
------------------------------------------------------------
- Stripped debug symbols from all userland binaries and kernel modules.
- Excluded unneeded manpages, locales, docs, and non-essential firmware from base ISO.
- Decoupled Debian APT repository cache and downloaded packages to persistent storage (/mnt/ssd) rather than bundling into base ISO.
- Maximum gzip compression (-9) on initramfs tree.
- Zero graphical desktop dependencies (terminal-only architecture).
